    s:issued: "Given by the user on 2026-10-28 in a Claude Code session (Claude Sonnet 5.5) as Zettel 11359, after the four local commits of the Topic Maps 6162ed68 integration: integrate the regular Catalog, its work packages and plan into the existing project scope, WBS, WBS Dictionary and Implementation Assignments, in two stages, and stop at the Scope Declaration Review." ;
    s:goal: "Propose the Work Item topic-maps-regular-hyperdoc and the Deliverable tm-regular-catalog with six work packages, six plan steps and their relations, and describe the packages in a draft WBS Dictionary, all as proposals, navigable in the Project Workspace. Prepare the Stage 2 declaration for review, without applying it: it has not been produced (no patch exists; only incomplete, unverified drafts are kept in docs/regular-catalog-scope/stage-2-draft/). Change no Work declaration, status or acceptance, and no Topic Maps or Catalog package." ;
    s:plan-step-note: "No Plan Step is confirmed for this assignment. Its text cannot make one. The assignment delivers no work package: it models the scope." ;
    s:observed-state: "Reported by the executor: a proposal in the working tree of a separate worktree, not committed. The Stage 2 declaration is not produced: stage-2-declaration.patch is a Stage 2 artifact that does not exist yet and is not a source authority of this assignment; the drafts in docs/regular-catalog-scope/stage-2-draft/ are incomplete and unverified. Zettel 11353 (the existing staging installation) and Zettel 11359 are the user's; neither is an acceptance. This report is not an acceptance." ;
    s:acceptance: "No acceptance by the user is recorded." ;
    s:precondition: "No Work declaration, status, Acceptance Record or historical evidence is changed; no proposal becomes a declaration." ;
