    s:precondition: "No commit, push, merge, deployment or server configuration without the user's separate authorization." ;
    s:precondition: "The project CTM is regenerated only by the emitter from the source pages, never edited." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "Every proposed ID is unique and every proposed work package has exactly one dictionary entry." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "WBS decomposition, plan dependencies and products are distinct Association types." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The proposal is read from the source page by the real emitter and reader; no parallel Topic Map is built." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The scope is navigable in a real HyperDoc browser session, with the source of each relation inspectable." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The prepared declaration is not applied and is complete: carrier page, declared dictionary, Work Breakdown entry and source registration." ;
    s:source-authority-note: "reads the Work Breakdown, authoritative for its Work declarations" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "reads the CTM plan page, authoritative for the vocabulary and relations of a declared WBS and plan" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "reads the WBS Dictionary, authoritative for the form of a dictionary entry" ;
