<tag:dreyeck.ch,2026:hyperdoc/assignment/cc-2026-10-28-project-workspace-6162ed68>
    isa s:implementation-assignment ;
    - "Claude Code: Bind the Project Workspace to Topic Maps 6162ed68" ;
    s:issued: "Given by the user on 2026-10-28 in a Claude Code session (Claude Sonnet 5.5) as the Complete the HyperDoc 6162ed68 Integration Review, before the commits: show in the actual Project Workspace that it reads the unchanged project CTM with the pinned revision, and do not bypass the Catalog's guard." ;
    s:goal: "Bind the Project Workspace to the pinned revision, identify a clean Git checkout, a verified Git-free snapshot and an unidentifiable directory apart, and show the unchanged project CTM read with it, in a browser." ;
    s:plan-step-note: "No Plan Step is confirmed for this assignment. Its text cannot make one; the proposed step tm-reg-p2 produces the package." ;
    s:observed-state: "Reported by the executor: committed locally as df5cf16e, not pushed. The criterion of 90 seconds was met with the snapshot and not met with the Git checkout under load; no run is recorded on an idle machine, on Linux, or with the snapshot as the root of the browser walk. Later step (Task 1E): the pin was moved to 88994c1b and committed locally as d9da94d8, e60d10ba and bc002546, not pushed; the criterion of 90 seconds was met on the combined tree on a previous revision of this proposal's CTM; no independent check of the integrated HyperDoc revision; the packaged Nix Catalog check was not run. This report is not an acceptance." ;
    s:acceptance: "No acceptance by the user is recorded." ;
    s:precondition: "No Work page and no project CTM is changed; the Catalog's guard is not bypassed." ;
    s:precondition: "The Workspace runs in the trusted review runtime, not in the guarded packaged Catalog." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "With Topic Maps 6162ed68 as a checkout and as the verified snapshot the unchanged project CTM is read without refusal within 90 seconds." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The signature and the CXTM equal the reference." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The pin fails for another commit, for another snapshot and for an unidentifiable directory." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "The packaged Catalog's startup guard still refuses the Project Workspace." ;
    s:acceptance-criterion: "Later step (Task 1E): with Topic Maps 88994c1b as a checkout and as the verified snapshot the original project CTM and the Stage 1 proposal's CTM are read and modelled within the unchanged 90 seconds; the pin fails for another commit, including a clean checkout of 6162ed68." ;
    s:source-authority-note: "binds the pin and reports the source identity" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "depends on the snapshot verifier" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "rewords the guard's refusal of the Project Workspace; the guard still refuses it" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "tests the pin and the identity" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "runs the Workspace against the Topic Maps ASDF finds in one fresh process" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "reads the retained project CTM; no Work page and no CTM is changed" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "later step (Task 1E): reads the committed integration record of Topic Maps 88994c1b in HyperDoc (commit bc002546): its evidence, its commit plan and its open items" ;
    s:source-authority-note: "later step (Task 1E): reads the verification of the previous Stage 1 CTM on the combined tree; Stage 1 proposal material — not declared or accepted" ;
    s:evidence-note: "HyperDoc commit df5cf16ebf53944325f737313cceae30a7ea2513 (tree 857211810fdd9d09f127e3f70cb6d2f0969389ff), \"Bind the Project Workspace to Topic Maps 6162ed68 and identify a Git-free snapshot\": local, unpushed, signed; a source change of the package, not an acceptance" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Reported by the executor, 2026-10-28T09:14:18Z, tree not recorded as a clean commit: the browser test passed in the trusted review runtime with the object-identity check and the named absence of an acceptance record. It ran on a scratch commit (21c3e3ee) holding the identical tree 857211810fdd9d09f127e3f70cb6d2f0969389ff that df5cf16e has, rehearsed before the commit, not on df5cf16e itself" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Reported by the executor, on the then-uncommitted integration worktree over the base commit 8e64e7189daf1c5615cbc8bbe40cff3bf2bcd1aa (a modified tree that is not fully reconstructible from that revision): with a clean Git checkout of Topic Maps 6162ed68 the pin was OK and the project CTM was read in 161 s on 2026-10-28 (06:36:17Z), so NOT within 90 s, on a machine with a load average of about 13; with the verified Git-free snapshot it was read in 38.7 s (06:42:12Z), within 90 s; in both the CXTM bytes were equal to the reference and the CTM input was unchanged" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Reported by the executor and not independently checked: a checkout of 5a4a668 and an unidentifiable export were refused as the pin (PIN-NOT-OK); the run against the b2eecffa snapshot reported PIN-NOT-OK and was stopped before its reader finished. The packaged Catalog's guard still refuses the Workspace" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Later step, Task 1E, 2026-10-28: the Workspace's pin was moved to 88994c1b in HyperDoc commit d9da94d8b47f2f1b68c567d6c621e64a5202fdc0 (tree 4e9f34124a9a18fc423ac3f1b8f5828c3139f561), followed by e60d10bad9aaaffb3f241e8022f2658eeed18241 (the review reading, tree 56ac6fbb700100cf28b9f2312049593277ee3a56) and bc0025464131781712e24da5ec05594d91637144 (the integration documentation, tree c36594ef725f6908946a0dc56a0263fd865441c7): local, unpushed; tested as one candidate, not each commit by itself. Implemented and locally integrated; neither a declaration nor an acceptance" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Later step, reported by the executor on the combined tree (bc002546 plus the uncommitted Stage 1 proposal, whose CTM then had SHA-256 fe2955e93239704673a2a38492ea92e57f0d221f14313603dd1dd5f206b340b8, a previous revision of the CTM), Topic Maps a clean Git checkout of 88994c1b, and not independently checked: the Project suite passed, with 345 source checks, 224 read-back checks with the model in 24.2 s against the unchanged 90-second check, 125 acceptance checks on synthetic fixtures and 196 scope checks; a browser walk of the Workspace and the scope passed. With the original CTM the integration script read the Workspace in 11.6 to 21.9 s and the Stage 1 CTM in 19.4 to 32.3 s on a busy machine; a control with the same Stage 1 bytes under 6162ed68 took 82.3 and 85.8 s against 23.7 s under 88994c1b (single observations). The results for the CTM this page now generates are recorded beside it, not here" ;
    s:evidence-note: "Later step, unresolved and preserved: the historical reading Integrating Topic Maps 6162ed68 is bound to 6162ed68 by design and its check pins:catalog-and-22u-reading-and-workspace-and-reading-name-one-commit fails in the current runtime, which is a failure and not a pass; the packaged Nix Catalog check was not run; the Stage 1 results come from a disposable copy and from a combined worktree of uncommitted Stage 1 material; not run on Linux, with the Stage 2 CTM, on the constrained host or at high arity" .

